\contentsline {deleted}{Deleted~(W): \truncate {\Changestruncatewidth }{ highlighting viral jokes about debate performances, aging candidates, migrant panics, and vice-presidential soundbites that turned into TikTok audio trends.}}{1}{section*.1}%
